# Do NOT copy this into public/CNAME until DNS for the hostname
# actually resolves. A published CNAME file makes GitHub Pages 301
# https://sunkara1111.github.io/portfolio/ to the custom domain and
# will break the live site if that hostname is NXDOMAIN.
#
# Intended hostname (registrar DNS only — this repo cannot set it):
#   Type  CNAME
#   Host  portfolio
#   Value sunkara1111.github.io
#
# portfolio.sunkaraops.com
